name>Medina</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nava</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of the leeds assessment of neuropathic symptoms and signs questionnaire in patients with fibromyalgia</article-title><source>Seminars in arthritis and rheumatism</source><year>2003</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>407</fpage><lpage>411</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12833249</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1053/sarh.2003.50017</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Potter</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Higginson</surname><given-names>IJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Scadding</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Quigley</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identifying neuropathic pain in patients with head and neck cancer: use of the Leeds Assessment of Neuropathic Symptoms and Signs Scale</article-title><source>Journal of the Royal Society of Medicine</source><year>2003</year><volume>96</volume><fpage>379</fpage><lpage>383</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12893852</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1258/jrsm.96.8.379</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perez</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Galvez</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Insausti</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruiz</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rejas</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>[Linguistic adaptation and Spanish validation of the LANSS (Leeds Assessment of Neuropathic Symptoms and Signs) scale for the diagnosis of neuropathic pain]</article-title><source>Med